    If cart velocity > 3 OR < -3, move in the opposite direction to slow down.
    If pole angular velocity > 3 OR < -3, move in the opposite direction of the pole's tilt to stabilize.
Else if cart position is outside [-12, 12] OR pole angle is outside [-18, 18]:
    Apply aggressive corrective actions:
        If pole angle > 0, move right aggressively (e.g., multiple steps).
        If pole angle < 0, move left aggressively (e.g., multiple steps).
