3. **Incremental Adjustments**: The strategy includes incremental adjustments for aggressive corrections to prevent sudden large changes that could destabilize the system.

This balanced approach aims to leverage the effectiveness of aggressive corrections while ensuring stability through moderate and gradual adjustments.
